void WorldEditor::paint(juce::Graphics&g){g.fillAll(juce::Colour(0xff302015));for(int side=0;side<2;side++){float x=side==0?0.f:(float)getWidth()-24.f;g.setGradientFill(juce::ColourGradient(juce::Colour(0xff24150f),x,0,juce::Colour(0xff63432a),x+24.f,0,false));g.fillRect(juce::Rectangle<float>(x,0.f,24.f,(float)getHeight()));for(int k=0;k<14;k++){juce::Path grain;grain.startNewSubPath(x+k*1.8f,0.f);for(int y=0;y<=getHeight();y+=20)grain.lineTo(x+k*1.8f+1.2f*std::sin(y*.018f+k*.7f),(float)y);g.setColour(juce::Colours::black.withAlpha(.24f));g.strokePath(grain,juce::PathStrokeType(.7f));}}for(int edge=0;edge<2;edge++){float y=edge==0?0.f:(float)getHeight()-10.f;juce::ColourGradient gold(juce::Colour(0xff72511a),0,y,juce::Colour(0xffa57828),0,y+10.f,false);gold.addColour(.24,juce::Colour(0xffffe89f));gold.addColour(.55,juce::Colour(0xffcca34e));gold.addColour(.78,juce::Colour(0xffead28b));g.setGradientFill(gold);g.fillRect(juce::Rectangle<float>(0.f,y,(float)getWidth(),10.f));}}

bool WorldEditor::isInterestedInFileDrag(const juce::StringArray&files){for(auto&name:files)if(juce::File(name).hasFileExtension("wav;aif;aiff;flac;ogg"))return true;return false;}
void WorldEditor::filesDropped(const juce::StringArray&files,int,int){for(auto&name:files){juce::File file(name);if(!file.hasFileExtension("wav;aif;aiff;flac;ogg"))continue;int pad=processor.selectedPad.load();auto r=processor.loadSample(pad,file);result(r);if(r.wasOk()){processor.triggers[(size_t)pad].fetch_add(1);notice="Loaded "+file.getFileName()+" onto selected pad "+juce::String(pad+1);noticeTicks=200;}break;}}
